    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me, under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Dr. H. M. Susil Ranasinghe, Minister of Housing, Construction and Water Supply, do hereby declare that, though the extent of the land mentioned in the Schedule of the order published on page 1A in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 2226/56 and dated 07.05.2021 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka was given as 3.084 Hectares, it shall be amended to read as 0.002529 Hectare, as an extent of 01 Perch of land is sufficient for the requirement of the project.",
